      "title": "अमन का बैग",
      "text": "का is the Hindi \"'s\": अमन का बैग is \"Aman's bag\". It also changes to match the thing owned: का for a masculine word, की for a feminine one (अमन की किताब), के for several.",
      "explains": [
        "hi.ka-ki"
      ],
      "afterScenes": 1
    },
    {
