      "kind": "usage",
      "title": "आप or तुम",
      "text": "Ravi, a teacher, says तुम and तुम्हारी to Aman, a child. Sam says आप and आपका to adults. तुम is for friends, family and children; use आप until you are invited to say तुम.",
      "explains": [
        "hi.tum-informal"
      ],
      "afterScenes": 1
    }
  ],
